speakerInvite.body:
Hi {{person_name}},

I hope you’re doing well.

I’m pleased to invite you to join us as a Speaker for the {{event_name}}, a builder sprint bringing together founders, engineers, designers, and creators to transform bold ideas into working prototypes using AI, software, and design.
This hackathon is designed to bring together a diverse community of builders to experiment, create, and launch. Participants will spend the day developing innovative products and solutions, culminating in live demos evaluated by a panel of industry experts. Theme is {{theme}}
{{tracks}}

Day & Date: {{event_date}}
Time: {{event_time}}
Location: {{event_place}}
Event Link: {{luma_link}}

As a speaker, you’ll have the opportunity to share your experience, insights, and perspective with a community of ambitious builders. Your talk or conversation can help participants think differently about building, technology, entrepreneurship, and the opportunities ahead.

Sponsors & Partners
The event is supported by an incredible group of sponsors {{sponsor_names}}, along with partners {{partner_names}}.

Given your background, experience, and expertise, we believe your perspective would be a valuable addition to our judging panel. We would be honored to have you join us and contribute to an exciting day of building, collaboration, and innovation.

We’ll share the session format, schedule, and all relevant logistics ahead of the event to ensure a smooth and enjoyable experience.

Thank you for considering our invitation. We hope to have you join us and look forward to welcoming you to the Bay Builders Hackathon.

Warm regards,

Saurabh Khire
Lead Organizer, {{event_name}}
CrewBase Collective

